OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Foccasional showers, these mainly in
OL,7,Fthe west while staying mostly dry in
OL,8,Fthe east. Winds will become light by
OL,9,Fafternoon. .
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with some bright spells at
OL,13,Ffirst. Outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain in the west overnight, staying
OL,15,Fmostly dry in the east. Freshening
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
