OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy rain in the morning then dry and
OL,7,Fbright for a time before further
OL,8,Fshowers in the afternoon and evening.
OL,9,FFresh to strong southerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells at first Monday, strengthening
OL,13,Fsouthwesterly winds and occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy showers later. Occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy rain or showers on Tuesday with
OL,16,Fstrong to gale force winds, this
OL,17,Fclearing through Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
